<title>USA: Pride Intl to deploy more assets.</title>
<headline>Pride Intl to deploy more assets.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pride International Inc said on Thursday  that the drilling contractor expects to deploy more assets through  the balance of 1997 and in the early part of 1998.</p>
<p>Pride, which reported higher second quarter results, said its results  do not include its acquired jackup rigs for the entire period and  the higher contract rates for its semi-submersible rigs that will  commence drilling in the third quarter.</p>
</text>
